		{
			dependencies: ["5501764E5CA9A762"]
			description: [
				"The way to obtain most resources in this pack is by using the sifter and a mesh."
				""
				"Each mesh has different outputs and requirements."
				""
				"It is recommended to check out each mesh by pressing U while hovering over it in JEI."
				""
				"Advanced meshes require a brass sifter to work."
				""
				"For some items, it is also required that the sifter be waterlogged."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"To use a sifter you can either drop items on top of it so it can pick them up, or you can use a hopper to insert them into it (pipes and chutes work as well)."
				""
				"When pulling items out of the sifter, you can right click on it to get the items inside or use a hopper (can be slow at extracting) or "
				"something like a chute or item pipe. "
			]
			icon: "createsifter:sifter"
			id: "16859CEB4147AFDD"
			rewards: [
